    "text": "My Ref. No. : 4-3/5/2018/HA/105. DS Ref. No. : DSM/YTT/LAND/5/50. BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Proviso (a) to Section 38 of the Land Acquisition Act, (Chapter 460) I, Nalaka Jude Harin Fernando, Minister of Tourism and Lands, do hereby direct the Acquiring O\ufb03 cer or any other o\ufb03 cer authorized by him referred to in paragraph 1 of the Schedule to take immediate possession of the land speci\ufb01 ed in the corresponding entry in paragraph 2 of that Schedule. Harin Fernando, Minister of Tourism and Lands.",
